<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves firm to $3.514 bln - Feb 26.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves firm to $3.514 bln - Feb 26.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Monday said its hard currency reserves firmed to $3.514 billion as of February 26, from $3.426 billion on February 19.</p>
<p>HARD CURRENCY RESERVES  Feb 26  Feb 19  Jan 29  Dec 31/96</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)    3.514   3.426   3.418    3.473</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	 1.830   1.857   1.920    2.321</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector  5.344   5.283   5.338    5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
